50-These results correct the project's earlier training-methods report on five points. First, **exhausting the step budget is not free**: under the done-flag rule it scores zero even when the final device state is correct. Second, **GUI-Owl does terminate its own episodes**, ending 24 itself with 23 correct; the earlier "never terminates" claim came from a summarizer that recognized only our own `status` action, which commit bebf929 fixed. Third, **GUI-Libra's 3B gain came mostly from data mixing**: mixing in reasoning-free copies of the data was worth **+6.1**, while action-token reweighting added only **+1.7** ([GUI-Libra](https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.22190)). Fourth, **LFM3-VL-2B does not use a SigLIP2 tower**; its vision encoder is an in-house 164M convolution-plus-attention model ([Liquid LFM3](https://www.liquid.ai/blog/lfm3)). Fifth, **adding a history screenshot is no longer a path to parity**, because under a matched-input rule every image added to LFM3 must also go to GUI-Owl, which was trained to use multi-image history.
