182:The disclosure should rank exposures from strongest to weakest: AW evaluation trajectories or seed-30 instances in training, AW templates at other seeds, AW checkers used as rewards, AW's 20 apps used with different tasks, and adaptive reuse of the test seed for selection. Our rule forbids the first three; the last two must be stated explicitly. AndroidControl spans 833 apps, and a full package-level screen of our SFT sources against AW's apps has not been completed ([Codex v4 audit](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/dataset_viability_v4.md)). Every v1-to-v3 decision also used seed 30.
